 mathquill-block-id=\"1\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"3\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"5\">0</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"8\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-first\">c</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"9\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">o</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"10\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">s</var><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"12\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"14\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"13\">4</span></span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\"16\">(</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"18\">x</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"20\">)</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"23\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-first\">s</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"24\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">i</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"25\" class=\"mq-operator-name mq-last\">n</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"27\">(</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"29\">x</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"31\">)</span></span></div></div>.</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>First, we express\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"34\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx